    <div class="card-title">Treasury curve</div>
    <div class="card-sub"><details class="fwork fwork-sub"><summary>Constant-maturity yields from treasury.gov, published once per business day — this is a daily fix, not an intraday feed. </summary><div class="fwork-b">Today’s curve is drawn solid over the last few publications, so the question the card answers is <b>which way it has been going</b>, not only where it is.</div></details></div>
  </div>
  <div class="card-body">
    <div class="tabs yc-modes" id="curveModes" role="tablist"><button type="button" class="tab" role="tab" aria-selected="true" title="Each publication at its own yields">Levels</button><button type="button" class="tab" role="tab" aria-selected="false" title="Each publication as basis points away from Thu, 30 Jul">Change</button></div>
